  "core.wormholeBattle.029": { zh: "🕳 {p1}交火结束：{p2}s · 我方开火 {p3}/命中 {p4} · 敌方开火 {p5}/命中 {p6} · 编队残血 {p7}%。", en: "🕳 Firefight with {p1} is over: {p2}s · we fired {p3}/hit {p4} · the enemy fired {p5}/hit {p6} · fleet hull {p7}%." },
