  "ui.Expedition.013": { zh: "停靠母港：星图上的悬赏情报已就绪——选个目标「出发」出击，战罢舰队会自动返航结算。", en: "Docked at the home port: bounty intel is ready on the star map — pick a target and Depart to attack, and the fleet flies home to settle up afterwards." },
