  "ui.Expedition.380": { zh: "」星系掩护巡逻驻留——从这里可即时出发远征、扫描或采矿；卸货、维修与换船需返回空间站。", en: "” system on escort patrol — from here you can set out on expeditions, scans or mining right away; unloading, repairs and switching ships all require returning to a station." },
