  "ui.FitPage.013": { zh: "装甲镀层・增厚板 / 货舱扩展 / 稳定器・射速计算机（伤害・射速支援）/ 协处理器", en: "Armor platings and thickeners / cargo expanders / stabilizers and rate-of-fire computers (damage and rate-of-fire support) / coprocessors" },
