  "ui.FitPage.017": { zh: "爆", en: "Explosive" },
  "ui.FitPage.018": { zh: "热", en: "Thermal" },
  "ui.FitPage.019": { zh: "档位基础：低级 5 / 中级 15 / 高级 40 CPU（炮台更高）；剩余 = 船体上限 + 协处理器扩容 − 已装占用（含无人机舱清单）。剩余 0 = 刚好装满（装得进，但加不了新件）；负数 = 超载（装不上，先卸件或装协处理器扩容）", en: "Tier base: low 5 / mid 15 / high 40 CPU (turrets cost more); left = hull cap + coprocessor expansion − what is fitted (drone bay list included). At 0 the ship is exactly full (nothing more fits); negative means overloaded (unfit something or add a coprocessor first)" },
