  "ui.Handbook.025": { zh: "产线归谁", en: "Who runs the line" },
  "ui.Handbook.026": { zh: "产线由主控（全局限 1 条、占主控不可离港）或一枚 AI 核心驱动（占用 AI 核心上限，见「AI 副船」）。", en: "A line is driven either by you (one at a time, using the manual slot and blocking undocking) or by an AI core (which counts against the AI core limit — see AI auxiliary ships)." },
  "ui.Handbook.027": { zh: "战斗与生存", en: "Combat and survival" },
  "ui.Handbook.028": { zh: "失利", en: "Defeat" },
  "ui.Handbook.029": { zh: "叠加规则", en: "Stacking rules" },
  "ui.Handbook.030": { zh: "CPU 预算", en: "CPU budget" },
  "ui.Handbook.031": { zh: "中槽推进器", en: "Mid-slot thrusters" },
  "ui.Handbook.032": { zh: "中槽「矢量推进器」是周期点火：开场即点火、持续 60 秒，随后冷却 60 秒——点火期间战斗机动显著提升、开火命中略降（失稳代价同样只在点火期生效），冷却期间两者都回到基础值；战斗界面底部显示推进器倒计时。", en: "A mid-slot vector thruster burns on a cycle: it lights up at the start of the fight and burns for 60 seconds, then cools for 60 seconds — during the burn, combat maneuverability rises sharply while accuracy drops a little (the instability penalty also applies only while burning), and both return to their base values while cooling. The thruster countdown sits at the bottom of the battle screen." },
  "ui.Handbook.033": { zh: "三层血的留存", en: "How the three HP layers persist" },
