  "ui.MapPage.079": { zh: "长途运输需要先建成至少一座副空间站（与母港之间才有航线可跑）——建站指引见「任务中心 · 重要任务/资源任务」。", en: "Long-haul transport needs at least one outpost built first (a route only exists between it and the home port) — see Task Center · Important tasks and Resource tasks for build guidance." },
