  "ui.MarketPage.032": { zh: "暂无现货", en: "No stock" },
  "ui.MarketPage.033": { zh: "（基础 5%；练「会计学 / 贸易谈判学」各 −8%/级，双满仅剩 1%）", en: "(base 5%; Accounting and Trade Negotiation each cut 8% per level, leaving only 1% with both maxed)" },
  "ui.MarketPage.034": { zh: "协会市场全程走挂单簿撮合：收购价低于供应价；集中买卖会带来价格短时偏离（冲击动量），原矿/原材料另受库存池调节。每行可「挂单买 / 挂单卖」自定价等待成交。行首星标＝标记收藏（被标记的商品在默认排序下置顶，随时再点一下取消）。", en: "The Association market matches everything through the order book: the buy price sits below the supply price, heavy trading pushes prices off for a while (impact momentum), and ore and materials are further steered by the stock pool. Every row can place a buy or sell order at your own price and wait. The star at the head of a row marks a favourite (marked goods float to the top of the default sort; click again to clear)." },
  "ui.MarketPage.035": { zh: "没有匹配的订单（试试清空搜索、切换类型或子分类）。", en: "No matching orders (try clearing the search, or switching type or subcategory)." },
  "ui.MarketPage.036": { zh: "现在", en: "Now" },
