  "ui.Wormhole.225": { zh: "舰船墓场：走到就铺好普通残骸 3~10 堆（不用激活）、稀有残骸每 3 堆普通判一次——要打捞器，每回合回收 = 台数 的堆。", en: "Ship graveyard: stepping on it lays out 3–10 piles of ordinary wrecks (no activation needed), and a rare wreck is rolled once every 3 ordinary piles — you need salvagers, and each turn recovers as many piles as you have salvagers." },
  "ui.Wormhole.226": { zh: "舰船信号：里面是敌人，到达即交火（没扫描过就闯进去，会先被对方发现、确认后再开战）；打赢固定获得残骸与稀有残骸。", en: "Ship signal: enemies are inside and contact starts on arrival (forcing your way in unscanned means being spotted first, then confirming before the fight); a win always yields wrecks and rare wrecks." },
  "ui.Wormhole.227": { zh: "虫洞谜质：取回后装进货仓（占 2×2 = 4 格），本趟探索期间一直生效——不一样的地点藏着不一样的装置，离开虫洞即失效。", en: "Wormhole Enigma: once recovered it goes into the hold (taking a 2×2 = 4 block) and stays active for the whole run — different sites hide different devices, and all of them lapse when you leave the wormhole." },
