  "ui.Wormhole.272": { zh: "遗迹：走到就铺好稀有残骸 2~3 堆（不用激活），小概率拿到一次性图纸或专属装备；打捞结束大概率触发一场恶战。", en: "Ruins: stepping on it lays out 2–3 piles of rare wrecks (no activation needed) with a small chance of a one-use blueprint or a dedicated module; finishing the salvage very likely triggers a hard fight." },
