  "ui.Wormhole.279": { zh: " —— 取回后装进货仓生效（占 2×2 = 4 格，腾不出会先进临时空间），离开虫洞即失效。", en: " — it takes effect once loaded into the hold (2×2 = 4 slots; without 2×2 free it goes into temporary space first) and lapses when you leave the wormhole." },
