  "ui.Wormhole.284": { zh: "腾位置用的临时格：不占货仓容量、不算超载；谜质储存器放这里不生效。离开本页（切去探索/关面板/撤离）前必须处理完：放回货仓 或 丢弃。", en: "Spare temporary slots: they use no hold capacity and do not count towards overloading, and Enigma canisters stored here have no effect. Everything here has to be handled before you leave the page (switching to exploring, closing the panel or withdrawing): put it back in the hold or discard it." },
  "ui.Wormhole.285": { zh: " 格", en: " slots" },
  "ui.Wormhole.286": { zh: "损伤是每趟各舰的结构与装甲损耗区间；结构有保底，绝不丢船", en: "Damage is the hull and armour wear range each ship takes per trip; hull has a floor, so a ship is never lost" },
  "ui.Wormhole.287": { zh: "损伤是每趟各舰的结构与装甲损耗区间（已按谜质科技折算：战斗线完成度 {p1}% ⇒ 损耗 ×{p2}，最多减半）；结构有保底，绝不丢船", en: "Damage is the hull and armour wear range each ship takes per trip (already scaled by Enigma tech: combat line {p1}% complete ⇒ wear ×{p2}, halved at most); hull has a floor, so a ship is never lost" },
  "ui.Wormhole.288": { zh: " 台 · 效率 ", en: " units · efficiency " },
  "ui.Wormhole.290": { zh: "编队打捞器台数：墓场与遗迹每次打捞按台数回收若干堆。打捞效率 {p1}%：每满 100% 必多捞 1 堆，余数按概率", en: "Salvagers in the formation: graveyards and ruins recover a number of piles per salvage based on how many are aboard. Salvage efficiency {p1}%: every full 100% guarantees one extra pile, and the remainder is a chance" },
  "ui.Wormhole.291": { zh: "编队采集器台数：矿脉每次采集按台数回收若干堆。采集效率 {p1}%：每满 100% 必多采 1 堆，余数按概率", en: "Miners in the formation: veins recover a number of piles per mining run based on how many are aboard. Mining efficiency {p1}%: every full 100% guarantees one extra pile, and the remainder is a chance" },
